<title>INDIA: India net Oct 1-25 FII purchases at $169.6 mln.</title>
<headline>India net Oct 1-25 FII purchases at $169.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net purchases by foreign institutional investors (FIIs) in Indian stock markets totalled $169.6 million from during the period from October 1 to October 25, the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said FIIs' net investments for the whole of September was $122.8 million.</p>
